    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "step away? what does that even mean? like just moving out or something? because it feels more permanent than that. like i'm fine, but everything i touch just breaks. i feel like if i wasn't even in the picture, they could finally just breathe and be happy without worrying about me constantly.",
